" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.519" end="48.386">我用</span><span begin="48.386" end="48.866">幾</span><span begin="48.866" end="49.088">行</span><span begin="49.088" end="49.560">字</span><span begin="49.560" end="50.318">形容</span><span begin="50.318" end="50.841">妳</span><span begin="50.841" end="51.268">是</span><span begin="51.268" end="51.615">我</span><span begin="51.615" end="51.838">的</span><span begin="51.838" end="53.411">誰</span></p></div><div begin="54.183" end="1:20.458" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="54.183" end="1:01.022" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.183" end="55.182">秋刀</span><span begin="55.182" end="56.012">魚</span><span begin="56.012" end="57.279">的滋味</span> <span begin="57.569" end="58.437">貓跟</span><span begin="58.437" end="59.303">妳</span><span begin="59.303" end="59.638">都</span><span begin="59.638" end="1:00.415">想了</span><span begin="1:00.415" end="1:01.022">解</span></p><p begin="1:01.308" end="1:07.397" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.308" end="1:03.067">初戀的香</span><span begin="1:03.067" end="1:03.363">味</span><span begin="1:03.363" end="1:04.624">就這樣</span><span begin="1:04.624" end="1:05.419">被我</span><span begin="1:05.419" end="1:06.418">們</span><span begin="1:06.418" end="1:06.910">尋</span><span begin="1:06.910" end="1:07.397">回</span></p><p begin="1:07.739" end="1:14.661" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.739" end="1:08.193">那</span><span begin="1:08.193" end="1:08.563">溫</span><span begin="1:08.563" end="1:09.441">暖</span><span begin="1:09.441" end="1:13.753">的陽光像剛摘的鮮豔草</span><span begin="1:13.753" end="1:14.661">莓</span></p><p begin="1:14.035" end="1:20.458" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.035" end="1:15.313">妳說妳</span><span begin="1:15.313" end="1:18.727">捨不得吃掉這一種</span><span begin="1:18.727" end="1:19.415">感</span><span begin="1:19.415" end="1:20.458">覺</span></p></div><div begin="1:20.761" end="1:47.494" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:20.761" end="1:27.356" itu